\pard\b\fs20 Gem Theft\b0\par
\fs16\par
The royal jewels are being kept in Castle Rekom in the Losmodos Valley until the treasury in Kaldor has been rebuilt. But a greedy band of rebels has got wind of it. So they have promptly pitched their camp near the castle, and now they try to break into the castle at night and steal as many of the gems as they can.\par
The goal of this melee is for the assassin team to steal a certain number of gems within a set time. The guards, of course, have to prevent exactly that.\par
